    "body": "Coordinator: I cancelled post-merge run 44982953354 (commit c05291a8b, #3126) on runner skull at 05:02Z.\n\n- Its gate job started at 03:58:12Z and was still in the step \"Batch gate tier\" after 63 minutes. A normal run takes about 22 minutes.\n- The API does not give the log of a running job, so I could not see whether its log still grew.\n- The commit is contained in f4b351682, and run 44986121542 on f4b351682 gates it. That run decides the state of `main`.\n- This is a second fault on skull, after the UI abort of run 44948384882 in the table above.\n",
