    "updated_at": "2026-11-22T05:52:23Z",
    "body": "Coordinator: one more runner fault, now on uma. Post-merge run 44987903117 (4d6b75e77, a commit that changes only `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION`) failed on uma at `app suites: bore_core`: 4 tests in 0 s. The re-run of the failed job (attempt 2) ran on wopr and was green, and #3289 closed itself. So the fault list is now: skull (UI lib, and a hung batch gate), egg (UI trace_parity), wopr (UI egui_app), uma (an app suite in 0 s). The 0 s failure on uma is not a UI binary, so the cause can be wider than the UI suites.\n",
